# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# KrishiBazar AI — environment variables (LOCAL development only)
# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored). For GitHub Pages, set the same name as a
# repository VARIABLE instead — see SETUP_GUIDE.md.
#
# This is the public URL of your deployed Google Apps Script web app. It is NOT
# a secret (it is embedded in the site), which is why every data action is
# protected by login + server-side authorisation inside the script.
#
# Leave it empty to run in local DEMO mode with built-in sample data.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_APPS_SCRIPT_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_DEPLOYMENT_ID/exec
